@startuml docs/features/workspace-projects.puml
title "Workspace — Liste de projets, aperçu SQL et organisation personnelle"

actor User
participant "Browser (/workspace)"
participant "React Component"
participant "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)"
database "Database (Prisma)"

== Nominal Case: Load Project List (200) ==
User ->> Browser: Open /workspace
Browser ->> "React Component": Load useVideoProjects()
"React Component" ->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": GET ?page=1&limit=20&search=&org=orgId
note right of "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": 1. Get current session\n2. Fetch org_id or create personal org\n3. SQL: videoProjects WHERE orgId=X\n4. Left join for lockedBy user name
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" ->> "Database (Prisma)": findMany({\n  where: { organizationId },\n  include: { media, lockedByUser }\n})
"Database (Prisma)" -->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": [{id, title, format, media, lockedBy, lockedByUser.name}]
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" -->> "React Component": 200 {data: [], total, page, limit}
"React Component" ->> Browser: Render grid (16:9, 9:16 thumbnails) + search + pagination
Browser -->> User: Workspace view with project thumbnails

== Nominal Case: Search Projects (200) ==
User ->> Browser: Type search "My Video"
Browser ->> "React Component": onSearch(q)
"React Component" ->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": GET ?search=My%20Video&org=orgId
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" ->> "Database (Prisma)": findMany({\n  where: { organizationId, title: { contains } }\n})
"Database (Prisma)" -->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": [{filtered projects}]
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" -->> "React Component": 200 {data, total}
"React Component" ->> Browser: Update grid with filtered results

== Nominal Case: Rename Project (200) ==
User ->> Browser: Click pencil icon on project
Browser ->> "React Component": openRenameDialog(projectId)
"React Component" ->> Browser: Show edit form
User ->> Browser: Type "New Name", click Save
Browser ->> "React Component": onRename(projectId, "New Name")
"React Component" ->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": PATCH /api/video-projects/[id] {title}
note right of "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": 1. Verify session + auth\n2. Check project ownership (orgId match)\n3. Validate title length
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" ->> "Database (Prisma)": update({\n  where: { id },\n  data: { title }\n})
"Database (Prisma)" -->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": {id, title}
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" -->> "React Component": 200 {success, data}
"React Component" ->> Browser: Update grid, show toast
Browser -->> User: "Renamed successfully"

== Nominal Case: Delete Project (200) ==
User ->> Browser: Click trash icon
Browser ->> "React Component": onDelete(projectId)
"React Component" ->> Browser: Confirm dialog
User ->> Browser: Click "Delete"
Browser ->> "React Component": confirmDelete(projectId)
"React Component" ->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": DELETE /api/video-projects/[id]
note right of "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": 1. Verify session + org owner\n2. Check project exists + ownership\n3. Cascade delete media
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" ->> "Database (Prisma)": delete({ where: { id } })
"Database (Prisma)" -->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": {id}
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" -->> "React Component": 200 {success}
"React Component" ->> Browser: Remove from grid, show toast
Browser -->> User: Project deleted

== Nominal Case: New Project Creation (201) ==
User ->> Browser: Click "New Project"
Browser ->> "React Component": openNewProjectDialog()
"React Component" ->> Browser: Show format selector (16:9, 9:16, square)
User ->> Browser: Select 16:9, click "Create"
Browser ->> "React Component": onCreate({format: '16:9'})
"React Component" ->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": POST /api/video-projects {format}
note right of "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": 1. Get session + org_id\n2. Validate format enum\n3. Create project + default storyboard
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" ->> "Database (Prisma)": create({\n  data: { title, format, organizationId, userId }\n})
"Database (Prisma)" -->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": {id, title, format}
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" -->> "React Component": 201 {success, data: {id}}
"React Component" ->> Browser: navigate(/storyboard/[id])
Browser -->> User: Storyboard editor opened

== Nominal Case: Personal Organization Auto-Create ==
User ->> Browser: First login, visit /workspace
Browser ->> "React Component": useEffect -> checkOrganization()
"React Component" ->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": GET /api/video-projects?org=null
note right of "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": 1. Session exists, no org_id in query\n2. Check if personal org exists (WHERE userId, isPersonal)\n3. If not: create org "User's workspace"
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" ->> "Database (Prisma)": findFirst({\n  where: { userId, isPersonal: true }\n}) OR create if missing
"Database (Prisma)" -->> "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": {id, name}
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" -->> "React Component": 200 {orgId}
"React Component" ->> Browser: Set orgId state, reload projects
Browser -->> User: Workspace loaded with auto personal org

== Edge Case: Unauthorized (401) ==
note right of "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": No session cookie
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" -->> "React Component": 401 Unauthorized
"React Component" ->> Browser: Redirect /auth/login

== Edge Case: Forbidden (403) ==
note right of "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": User not in org (cross-org attempt)
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" -->> "React Component": 403 Forbidden
"React Component" ->> Browser: Show error, redirect /workspace

== Edge Case: Invalid Input (400) ==
note right of "React Component": Client-side validation (title length, format enum)
"React Component" -->> Browser: Show inline error

== Edge Case: Conflict (409) ==
note right of "API Route (GET /api/video-projects)": Project not found OR org mismatch
"API Route (GET /api/video-projects)" -->> "React Component": 409 Not Found
"React Component" ->> Browser: Show error "Project deleted"

@enduml
